# TR House Telvanni: "Uncharted Waters" (TR_m1_HT_Dr2). Malvas Relvani's "chores" adds "vital experiment"; complying
# (Choice 1) sends the player to Archmagister Dral in Tel Thenim within a day (10, TR_m1_q_Dr2Timer: late logs 45).
# Dral's "What do you have in mind?" (Choice 1) logs 20 and starts TR_M1_Q68_PocRel_scpt: the player is sent to
# Dral's Sanctum for 17 seconds, brought back (30) and force-greeted (40, his reward). Malvas pays (41, +5 reputation).
# PositionCell stands in for the travel; the script does the rest itself.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_ht_fa2_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case ht_dr2_start
run
player->PositionCell 275 6977 13830 0 "Port Telvannis, Telvanni Council House: Chambers"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Malvas_Relvani"->GetDistance player < 2500
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Malvas_Relvani
ask chores
ask vital experiment
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Dr2 == 10
bye
end

case ht_dr2_sanctum
run
player->PositionCell 3168 5250 14784 0 "Port Telvannis, Tel Thenim: Archmagister's Chamber"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Rilvin_Dral"->GetDistance player < 800
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Rilvin_Dral
ask vital experiment
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Dr2 == 20
bye
until 3600 GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Dr2 >= 40
bye
expect player->GetItemCount "TR_m1_q_Dr2Reward" == 1
end

case ht_dr2_done
run
EnablePlayerControls
player->PositionCell 275 6977 13830 0 "Port Telvannis, Telvanni Council House: Chambers"
until 600 "TR_m1_T_Malvas_Relvani"->GetDistance player < 2500
wait 120
talk TR_m1_T_Malvas_Relvani
ask vital experiment
expect GetJournalIndex TR_m1_HT_Dr2 == 41
bye
end
